{"ma": "VALIANT", "ten": "Valiant Communications", "mo_ta": "Established in 1993, Valiant Communications (VCL) designs and manufactures advanced IT/OT communication, synchronization, protection, transmission, network-attached storage (NAS), Storage Area Network (SAN) data storage, and cybersecurity equipment and solutions tailored for critical infrastructure and utility / SCADA applications.

With successful installations in 110+ countries, our technologies serve power utilities, railways, oil & gas, airports, defense, and SCADA systems across the globe.

VCL's equipment is successfully deployed in over 6000+ power substations, ranging from 765kV to 33kV, supporting mission-critical operations with unmatched reliability and performance. Our mission is to deliver reliable, secure, and future-ready technologies that enhance the performance and resilience of industrial and utility networks through consistent innovation and engineering excellence.", "thu_tu": "0", "ghi_chu": "Tên đầy đủ: Valiant Communications Limited; thành lập năm 1993.", "xuat_xu": "Ấn Độ", "trang_web": "https://www.valiantcom.com/"}

